From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:49:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xgameruntime: Implement XError and route XErrorReport() to
 the title's callback.

XErrorSetCallback() and XErrorSetOptions() keep the title's callback and options, and the
XErrorReport() export, through which GDK libraries report errors, calls that callback.
OutputDebugStringOnError is applied; breaking into a debugger and failing fast are logged, not
applied.

Original work for macrock (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

Topic: xerror
